// `Module name(params) { declarations }` is a parameterised block; `Use name(args) As prefix` instantiates it, replacing each parameter by its argument and prefixing every name the module declares with `prefix-`.
Fact asset Identified by A, B
Fact coin Identified by C
Module pool(item) {
  Fact balance Identified by item * int
  Fact funded Identified by item Holds when (Exists balance: balance.item == item && balance.int > 0)
}
Use pool(asset) As a
Use pool(coin) As c.
+a-balance(A, 5).
+c-balance(C, 0).
?a-funded(A).
?!a-funded(B).
?!c-funded(C).
